RUN: not %COMPILE --error-format clang build plc.json 2>&1 | %CHECK %s

An element without an execution order is not targetable, so its diagnostic
names only the file; the element itself is named in the message. The lit
error config raises the E084 warning to an error, so the build fails.
CHECK: {{.*}}unconnected_variables.cfc: error[E084]: Element `foo` is unconnected and will be ignored
CHECK: {{.*}}unconnected_variables.cfc: error[E084]: Element `bar` is unconnected and will be ignored
CHECK: error: Compilation aborted due to critical errors
